   "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/UnluckyY1/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/UnluckyY1\">@UnluckyY1</a> ,</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is not something that the Dart team is likely to take on. It should be possible to a member of the community to tackle this by adding the needed APIs to <code class=\"notranslate\">package:win32</code> and then implementing the HTTP API using them.</p>",
